</td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="font-size:0px;padding:0;word-break:break-word;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:598px;"><img alt="Saturday Edition - The Guardian" height="auto" src="https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.-maoMBGKBrIn6te6KzY9assuTJHoR_xtxJtNZ-864UlQkcBqXk37DcflHDQza1QLUuYqdDslfFjUReql5n9xVPPVc9ug2zg8ow2L2QAZwmP-BmMTwRz-sGCTn143XFsC7m_LLq-pSl3nNE51Z4CkNXJumoz-sYL97MmtUVw32-fKwp6OCnS3St2qq91FSK4fhbYpwC30XlUD1_C57RoHlg/4hx/C6woAoPbRqilX5KfMvsU_g/t1/h001.UTvw4L7bkK9CWW_hlLQhwjpvB0pv4lfvj5YUbuiffDY style="border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;" width="598"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td><!-- Braze Placeholder - header --></td></tr><tr><td align="center" style="background:#FFFFFF;font-size:0px;padding:0 0px 0px;word-break:break-word;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;"><tbody><tr><td style="width:598px;"><img alt="England defender Millie Bright with a copy of the Guardian after England’s 2022 Euros win" height="auto" src="https://ablink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.-maoMBGKBrIn6te6KzY9assuTJHoR_xtxJtNZ-864Ulo6LRl66r9ZY4GDLtOydzZYtzIvyThtFFv6a05w-OjwzLJzr1yxeiz-Niu8XqmHRVcymuz6X1kGgIh0Tjd42L_B8ayEAg_JIcBBApClWZb2OUQQGH38YxvVZvyCnKW8_jAs9T7pdNujO9243A_NAD_RkNxMVBVMjdYn18kKDg0WLH0m7ekpUX4yXl9ba6ZpeWGlLtGGKeoefUI5oBNVorv/4hx/C6woAoPbRqilX5KfMvsU_g/t2/h001.qX4JMIzC8biqIriWzf2HapzbDcCwXxYjasoRatMiQMI style="border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;" width="598"></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td align="left" class="text headline-text" style="background:#052962;font-size:0px;padding:16px;word-break:break-word;"><div style="font-family:Georgia, serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1;text-align:left;color:#00